# ---- Vendored third-party tooling (cc10x plugin: local dev aid, not part of the product) ----
.claude/cc10x/

# ---- External dev-tool models and their API keys — CONTAINS SECRETS, never commit ----
docs/DEV_MODELS.local.md
*.local.md

# ---- Poster: brand-licensed Nebius assets/fonts + heavy PDF/PNG exports — keep the WHOLE folder out of git ----
design/brand/
design/poster/
